# Editor duplicates & backup files — never commit.
# Nuxt registers any *.vue under pages/ as a live route, so a stray "index - Copy.vue"
# ships as a real bundled page. Also keeps *.bak and backups/ safety copies out of git.
*Copy*
* - Copy*
*.bak
*.bak-*
**/backups/
